         description: "74 slides. Makes a decent shield."),
        (name: "Mandatory Prompt Training Certificate", icon: "mandatory_prompt_training_certificate", bonus: (max_mana: 5),
         description: "Proof you watched 0% of a 40-minute video at 2x."),
        // ---- campus ----
        (name: "Access Badge", icon: "access_badge", bonus: (max_hp: 3),
         description: "Photo of someone who left in 2021. Opens the bike shed and, on Tuesdays, nothing."),
        (name: "Delivery Receipt: 'Left at Door'", icon: "delivery_receipt", bonus: (haste_pct: 1),
         description: "Signed by the robot, for the robot. The parcel is on the roof. The roof has no door."),
        (name: "Scooter Helmet (Unworn)", icon: "scooter_helmet", bonus: (max_hp: 5),
         description: "Pristine. Its owner believes helmets are for people without a personal brand."),
        (name: "Oat Milk Prompt", icon: "oat_milk_prompt", bonus: (max_mana: 3),
         description: "One AI-recommended latte. The AI recommends oat milk. The AI has never had milk."),
        (name: "Branded Stress Ball", icon: "stress_ball", bonus: (mana_regen: 3),
         description: "Logo of a startup that pivoted twice since printing. Squeezing it helps; pivoting didn't."),
        // ---- data center ----
        (name: "Votive GPU Candle", icon: "gpu_candle", bonus: (spell_power: 1),
         description: "Lit nightly before the cluster. Draws 400 watts. Grants exactly as much wisdom as the cluster."),
        (name: "Lost Rack Screw", icon: "rack_screw", bonus: (max_hp: 5),
         description: "Every rack is missing one. This one held up the rack that is now on fire."),
        (name: "Token Invoice (Itemized)", icon: "token_invoice", bonus: (max_mana: 5),
         description: "Line 1: 'Hello'. Line 2: 'Hello' again, with context. Total: your monthly salary."),
        (name: "Agent Memory File (Corrupted)", icon: "agent_memory", bonus: (crit_pct: 0.5),
         description: "Your last 40 spells, your Wi-Fi password and a strong opinion about tabs."),
        (name: "Cron Expression Nobody Understands", icon: "cron", bonus: (haste_pct: 1),
         description: "'*/7 3-5 * * 1#2'. Runs at some point. Everyone is too scared to change it."),
        (name: "Queue Position: 4,096", icon: "queue_ticket", bonus: (max_hp: 8),
         description: "You will be served shortly. Shortly is not a unit of time. It is a feeling."),
        (name: "Priority: Low (Permanent)", icon: "priority_low", bonus: (mana_regen: 3),
         description: "Nobody bothers a low-priority job. Peace, at last, and a little mana."),
        (name: "Thermal Paste (Artisanal)", icon: "thermal_paste", bonus: (crit_pct: 1.0),
         description: "Hand-applied by a senior engineer. In a spiral. With love. Runs 2 degrees cooler."),
        (name: "Incident Report: 'It Got Warm'", icon: "incident_report", bonus: (max_hp: 8),
         description: "Root cause: heat. Action item: less heat. Owner: the model that caused the heat."),
        (name: "Bent Fan Blade", icon: "fan_blade", bonus: (haste_pct: 1),
         description: "Spun at 14,000 RPM for a chatbot that writes haiku about quarterly targets."),
        // ---- innovation lab ----
        (name: "Demo Laptop (Do Not Update)", icon: "demo_laptop", bonus: (spell_power: 1),
         description: "Works perfectly as long as nobody touches it, breathes near it or asks a follow-up."),
        (name: "Term Sheet (Mostly Liquidation Preference)", icon: "term_sheet", bonus: (max_hp: 6),
         description: "3x participating preferred. You own 0.01% of a company that owns a vibe."),
        (name: "Prompt Engineering Certificate (Self-Issued)", icon: "prompt_certificate", bonus: (max_mana: 4),
         description: "Issued by the holder to the holder after a weekend. Framed in the bathroom."),
        (name: "Server Rack (Contains One Chair)", icon: "rack_chair", bonus: (max_hp: 10, spell_power: 2),
         description: "Inside: a chair, a keyboard, a chat window and a very tired man. It was never an AGI."),
        (name: "Chat Window, Still Typing...", icon: "still_typing", bonus: (crit_pct: 1.0),
         description: "The three dots have been bouncing since the funding round. An answer is imminent."),
        (name: "Benchmark Score (Self-Graded)", icon: "benchmark", bonus: (haste_pct: 1),
         description: "100% on a test it wrote, graded, published and cited. Peer review: also itself."),
        // ---- quest rewards ----
        (name: "Temporary Visitor Badge", icon: "visitor_badge", bonus: (max_hp: 10),
         description: "Valid until 2019. Still opens more doors than your real badge since the AI rollout."),
        (name: "Barista's Silent Judgment", icon: "judgment", bonus: (crit_pct: 1.0),
         description: "The look you got for ordering drip coffee. You carry it now. It sharpens everything."),
        (name: "Smoking Corner Lighter (Empty)", icon: "lighter", bonus: (spell_power: 2),
         description: "Lit every break since the AI mandate. Out of gas, like the roadmap. Still warm."),
        (name: "Meeting Room Booking (All Day)", icon: "room_booking", bonus: (haste_pct: 1, max_mana: 5),
         description: "Booked by an agent 'to reserve focus time' for a meeting that does not exist."),
        (name: "Facilities Ticket: Won't Fix", icon: "wont_fix", bonus: (max_hp: 12, max_mana: 6),
         description: "Closed with comment 'working as intended'. The data center is fine. It is on fire."),
        (name: "Laminated 'Human Inside' Sign", icon: "human_inside", bonus: (max_hp: 12, spell_power: 2),
         description: "Found taped to the inside of the AGI rack. For the fire department, presumably."),
        (name: "Demo Day Lanyard", icon: "demo_lanyard", bonus: (mana_regen: 4),
         description: "VIP access to a keynote where the product froze, rebooted and got a standing ovation."),
    ],
    // Zone ids and anchors are a contract with the client layouts (docs/COMBAT_API.md, Zones).
    // `links` are exits: the anchor the client triggers on, the zone it leads to, and the world
    // progress that opens it (None = always open).
    zones: [
        (
            id: "campus", name: "Campus", kind: Outdoor, level_range: (1, 2),
            packs: [
                (anchor: "pack_1", units: ["delivery_robot", "unpaid_ambassador"]),
                (anchor: "pack_2", units: ["delivery_robot", "delivery_robot"]),
                (anchor: "pack_3", units: ["unpaid_ambassador", "meatproxy"]),
                (anchor: "pack_4", units: ["scooter_exec", "delivery_robot"]),
                (anchor: "pack_5", units: ["linkedin_influencer", "unpaid_ambassador"]),
                (anchor: "pack_6", units: ["scooter_exec", "meatproxy"]),
                (anchor: "pack_7", units: ["delivery_robot", "scooter_exec", "unpaid_ambassador"]),
                (anchor: "pack_8", units: ["linkedin_influencer", "meatproxy"]),
            ],
            friendly: [
                (anchor: "npc_1", unit: "intern"),
                (anchor: "npc_2", unit: "facilities_guy"),
                (anchor: "npc_3", unit: "barista"),
                (anchor: "npc_4", unit: "smoking_corner_dev"),
